---
const year = 2026;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
	<div class="footer-inner">
		<div class="brand">
			<strong class="name">按摩店增长指南</strong>
			<p>面向按摩店、按摩师和养生馆的本地搜索、评价和预约转化资源。</p>
		</div>

		<div class="cols">
			<div>
				<h3>栏目</h3>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="/google-maps/">Google 地图</a></li>
					<li><a href="/reviews/">客户评价</a></li>
					<li><a href="/website-conversion/">网站转化</a></li>
					<li><a href="/massage-seo/">按摩 SEO</a></li>
					<li><a href="/templates/">模板</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h3>信任页面</h3>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="/about/">关于</a></li>
					<li><a href="/editorial-policy/">编辑政策</a></li>
					<li><a href="/contact/">联系</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<p class="copy">© {year} 按摩店增长指南. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

<style>
	.site-footer {
		margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
		padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem) clamp(1rem, 4vw, 1.75rem) 1.75rem;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a3349 0%, #082836 100%);
		color: #e8f2f9;
		border-top: 1px solid #143d55;
		overflow-x: clip;
	}
	.footer-inner {
		max-width: 1180px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
		gap: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem);
		align-items: start;
	}
	.brand .name {
		display: block;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
		color: #ffffff;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}
	.brand p {
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 26rem;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #b8d4e8;
	}
	.cols {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
	}
	.cols h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #7eb3d4;
	}
	.cols ul {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}
	.cols a {
		color: #f0f7fc;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.94rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
		transition:
			color 0.15s ease,
			border-color 0.15s ease;
	}
	.cols a:hover {
		color: #ffffff;
		border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
	}
	.copy {
		margin: 2rem auto 0;
		max-width: 1180px;
		padding-top: 1.35rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: #8eb8d4;
		text-align: center;
	}
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.footer-inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.cols {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 420px) {
		.cols {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
